{"id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-abstract-expressibility.md","title":"Expressibility in an Abstract Language","display":"df-abstract-expressibility — Expressibility in an Abstract Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-abstract-expressibility","aliases":["92-df-abstract-expressibility"],"display":"df-abstract-expressibility — Expressibility in an Abstract Language","source":"第 I 章，pp. 5–7、10（PDF 22–24、27）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-abstract-expressibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-abstract-expressibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-expressibility — Expressibility in an Abstract Language"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章，pp. 5–7、10（PDF 22–24、27）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1edb9c65c85c539f\" href=\"?note=1edb9c65c85c539f\" title=\"92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language\">92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in H\">\\(K\\in H\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq H\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq H\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 为下文定义的可表达关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Consistent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Consistent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 为下文定义的结构性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}expressibility}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi(K,n)\\in T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists K\\in H\\;\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow P\\subseteq T\\land R\\cap T=\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Consistent}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow P\\cap R=\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow S=P\\cup R,\\\\\nP_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}&amp;\\coloneqq g[P],\\quad\nR_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}\\coloneqq g[R],\\quad T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}\\coloneqq g[T].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}expressibility}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi(K,n)\\in T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists K\\in H\\;\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow P\\subseteq T\\land R\\cap T=\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Consistent}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow P\\cap R=\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow S=P\\cup R,\\\\\nP_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}&amp;\\coloneqq g[P],\\quad\nR_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}\\coloneqq g[R],\\quad T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}\\coloneqq g[T].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>“可表达”只调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，不调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R\">\\(P,R\\)</span>。正确性同时约束可证句和可反驳句，故推出一致性；普通一致性并不反向推出正确性。带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\">\\(\\#\\)</span> 的三个集合均是自然数码集，不能与句子集合直接相交。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章，pp. 5–7、10（PDF 22–24、27）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language","status":"resolved","id":"1edb9c65c85c539f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq H\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Consistent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}expressibility}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi(K,n)\\in T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists K\\in H\\;\\mathrm{ExprBy}_{\\mathcal L}(K,A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}&\\Longleftrightarrow P\\subseteq T\\land R\\cap T=\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Consistent}_{\\mathcal L}&\\Longleftrightarrow P\\cap R=\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathcal L}&\\Longleftrightarrow S=P\\cup R,\\\\\nP_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}&\\coloneqq g[P],\\quad\nR_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}\\coloneqq g[R],\\quad T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}\\coloneqq g[T].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"P,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\#","display":false}],"bytes":1991,"backlinks":[{"id":"73782856c9b2f46a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2ae549c14f89182f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]] → [[92-df-abstract-expressibility]] → [[92-df-diagonal-pullback]] → [[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]。"},{"id":"97f80cc5c73f0d60","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}$、$\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}$ 是[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]的性质；$R_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[R]$，星号是对角逆像。"},{"id":"1d0a7d81ddf7d082","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}$、$\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}$ 是[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]的性质；$P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[P]$，星号是对角逆像。"},{"id":"fc6f6230ad54a0dc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]"}],"outgoing":["1edb9c65c85c539f"]}